msgctxt "92"
msgid "(An animal backpack... Is this finally Sakura?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Hey, what's your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I'm looking for a lost girl. Her name is Sakura."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Hey, that's my name! But I'm not lost..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "I'll be back in a second. I'm going to get your mother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "Sakura! Where on earth have you been!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Huh!? But you told me to wait here while you did your shopping."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"I did no such thing! I've been looking for you all over this arcade, young "
"lady!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"This happened last vacation, too, Mommy! You got totally lost, and Daddy "
"said you had no sense of direction at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Huh? Oh no, Daddy said that too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "(Looks like Mom's the one who got lost.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Anyway... Where'd you get that backpack?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I traded for it! Isn't it the cutest?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"It is! And it wouldn't have been cheap if we bought it at retail price..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Oh, that's right. I have to thank you... For finding my Sakura."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "This isn't much, but I insist. It's the least I can do to thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "You got <Color:8>3,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>30.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Okay, Sakura, let's go. And don't leave my sight again, you hear me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Bye bye, mister! Sorry about my mom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"(She pulled off a lot of trades while her mother was wandering... Guess she "
"gets her smarts from her dad.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

